    - removed script change log before v1.3.0 - full log: https://gswiki.play.net/Lich:Script_Ebounty
  v1.3.11 (2024-09-24)
    - fix to allow for CLI foraging without setting Gem/Default profile
  v1.3.10 (2024-08-19)
